{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang banyak membawakan komik favorit kalian REDICE dan penulis yang membawakan Nano Machine dan Absolute Sword Sense\nJeong sang Slaughtering Scythe Demon merasakan kesenangan dalam membunuh orang lain\nDia kebetulan terlihat seperti Mok Gyeongwoon Tuan Muda Ketiga dari Mok Sword Manor\nKalau kau ingin berpurapura menjadi diriku dan menjalani hidupku aku akan mengeluarkanmu dari penjara ini\nApa kau sungguh akan memberikan aku kesempatan itu\nAhhh\nDia membunuh Tuan Muda Ketiga dan menjalani hidupnya berpurapura menjad dirinya\nApakah Mok Gyeongwoon yang palsu akan bertahan di kehidupan ini\nSang pembunuh berantai memulai hidupnya sebagai Tuan Muda Ketiga dari Mok Sword Manor yang hebat\nINPO\nLegend Of Heavenly Chaos Demon terjadi 800 Tahun lalu sebelum Cheon Yeo Woon Nano Machine\nDan Soh Woonhwi Absolute Sword Sense terjadi 1000 Tahun lalu sebelum Cheon Yeo Woon Nano Machine","alternative_title":"괴력 난신, Myst, Might, Mayhem, The Chaotic God of Extraordinary Strength","author":"Hanjoong Wolya","artist":"Redice Studio, Kim Tae-Hyung","chapters":[{"number":"110","chapter":"110","slug":"ch_110","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"f2bb702d-c028-4891-bf74-fd0b6a96285e","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"SEASON 1 END","date":"2026-03-11","released":"2026-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"868db388-ad20-46cc-a60c-83b1d2f2d50f","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"Setara","date":"2026-03-03","released":"2026-03-03"},{"chapter_id":"333cee62-74cf-483e-bda6-2013ebe0a298","number":"107","chapter":"107","title":"Creation Realm","date":"2026-02-24","released":"2026-02-24"},{"chapter_id":"1d7f2df2-b1bf-42db-92c0-45d65d1fb66e","number":"106","chapter":"106","title":"Dinding","date":"2026-02-17","released":"2026-02-17"},{"chapter_id":"83547066-1510-4b94-a86a-aa6c88cd7bb4","number":"105","chapter":"105","title":"Na Yullyang","date":"2026-02-10","released":"2026-02-10"},{"chapter_id":"b26b062f-6d07-41a1-ae06-cd5a8fa4eeab","nu